From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zurker <91011862+hershate@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:10:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] compat: pipeline-purity guard and content-verified memos for
 shared packets

Shared packet instances (chunk sends, join caches, pairing sweeps) and wire memos are now only served to connections whose netty pipeline contains exactly the vanilla-installed handlers (PapoPipelineGuard, fail-closed); the compression memo additionally verifies a content hash of the current connection's bytes before replaying; player-info packets never memo (per-receiver-locale displayName codec).

